    "detailed_description": "Are you tired of the routine and dullness of daily life? Want something new? Then what about forester's adventures in the most ordinary forest?<br />\r\nForesters are in danger at every turn, but you need to keep an eye on the forest, something happens all the time -wolves wander around, then bears, and sometimes someone even more terrible ...<br />\r\nTry to survive for a week in such conditions, let's see how you can cope.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Every day in the forest there are new problems, help the forester solve them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Pistols? Rifles? Why is this necessary if there is a good old shovel that will send any creep to the other side.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Forest, your own world, which will help you both settle in and feed yourself.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-There are no epic fights or large-scale battles, but the variety of adventures will pleasantly surprise you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Nice soundtrack will help you immerse yourself in the atmosphere.",
